OC_School_ES_Mechanics1::
	msgbox OC_School_Text_Mechanics1, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end
OC_School_Text_Mechanics1:
	.string "Type Matchups in Selenia:\p"
	.string "Bug resists Fairy and beats it,\n"
	.string "Ice resists Water and Fairy,\p"
	.string "Poison beats Water, while Psychic\n"
	.string "resists Ground, Poison, and Fairy!$"
OC_School_ES_Mechanics2::
	msgbox OC_School_Text_Mechanics2, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end
OC_School_Text_Mechanics2:
	.string "Pokémon Typings unique to Selenia:\p"
	.string "Vulpix/Ninetales is Fire/Psychic,\n"
	.string "Ampharos is Electric/Dragon,\p"
	.string "Voltorb/Electrode is Electric/Grass,\n"
	.string "Slowbro/Slowking is Poison/Psychic,\p"
	.string "Grimer/Muk is Poison/Dark,\n"
	.string "Koffing/Weezing is Poison/Fire,\p"
	.string "Doduo/Dodrio is Ground/Flying,\n"
	.string "Octillery is Water/Rock,\p"
	.string "and Tropius is Grass/Dark!\n"
	.string "Whew! What a mouthful!$"
OC_School_ES_Mechanics3::
	msgbox OC_School_Text_Mechanics3, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end
OC_School_Text_Mechanics3:
	.string "Individual Values/Effort Values:\p"
	.string "For some odd reason, all Pokémon\n"
	.string "native to Selenia have perfect IVs;\p"
	.string "31 in all six stats! And they can\n"
	.string "also max out all of their EVs too!$"
OC_School_ES_Mechanics4::
	msgbox OC_School_Text_Mechanics4, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end
OC_School_Text_Mechanics4:
	.string "Weather Conditions in Battle:\p"
	.string "There are four types of weather:\n"
	.string "Sun, Rain, Snow, and Sandstorm.\p"
	.string "Sun boosts Fire but weakens Water,\n"
	.string "while Rain is opposite, both by 50%.\p"
	.string "Snow boosts Ice types' Defense and\n"
	.string "Sandstorm boosts Rock types' Sp. Def,\p"
	.string "both also by 50%. Snow also\n"
	.string "boosts Ice type moves by 25%.\p"
	.string "Sandstorm does 1/16 max HP damage,\n"
	.string "except to Rock, Ground, and Steel.$"
OC_School_ES_Mechanics5::
	msgbox OC_School_Text_Mechanics5, MSGBOX_SIGN
	end
OC_School_Text_Mechanics5:
	.string "On Abilities, Expanded:\p"
	.string "Boom Box boosts sound moves while\n"
	.string "while also protecting vs them.\p"
	.string "Weather abilities are permanent\n"
	.string "and heal 1/16 max HP while active.\p"
	.string "Sun Soak, Rain Dish, and Ice Body\n"
	.string "heal 1/8 max HP in their weathers.\p"
	.string "Solid Rock and Filter both\n"
	.string "halve super effective damage.\p"
	.string "Solar Power grants a 1.3x boost\n"
	.string "to Electric/Fire/Grass in Sun.\p"
	.string "Gorilla Tactics deals 1.3x damage,\n"
	.string "but Reckless & Iron Fist do 1.25x.\p"
	.string "Suction Cups prevents held items\n"
	.string "from being swapped or taken away.\p"
	.string "Castform's Forecast activates if\n"
	.string "it's holding a weather extender.$"
	//.string "Shellemental makes all types do\n"
	//.string "neutral damage except Fire & Ice.$"
