	.string "Hello! Welcome to the\n"
	.string "New Ebonheart Review Center!\p"
	.string "Feel free to browse the blackboards\n"
	.string "to brush up on your battle knowledge!\p"
	.string "And don't worry, you can use your\n"
	.string "phone to take pics of the lessons!$"
